{"product_id":"dont-stop-me-now","title":"Don't Stop Me Now","description":"\u003cp\u003eJeremy Clarkson knows there's more to life than cars. There is, after all, a whole world out there just waiting to be discovered. So, before he gets on with the job in hand, he'd like to take some time out to consider the bigger picture. Don't worry, he'll get on to the car bit eventually, but before we do, there's time to learn about: bull; Why Galapagos tortoises are all mental bull; France, reduced to the size of a small coconut bull; Why Jeremy Paxman and the bass guitarist of AC\/DC aren't so very different The problems of being English and God's most stupid creation And then there's the cars: Whether it's the poxiest little runabout or an exotic, firebreathing supercar, anything on four wheels is approached without fear or favour. What emerges from the ashes is not always pretty. But it is, invariably, very, very funny. \u003cbr\u003e\n Dimensions:156 x 236  \u003cbr\u003e\n Author: Jeremy Clarkson \u003cbr\u003e\n ISBN: 9780718149055 \u003cbr\u003e\n Format: Hardback \u003cbr\u003e\n Pages 400\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookhero.ae","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":43548702671001,"sku":"15RC-3-9780718149055","price":20.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/c9731d2fbe3aa81c6e94fe6ecfd47cd9.jpg?v=1725728756","url":"https:\/\/bookhero.ae\/products\/dont-stop-me-now","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - BookHero","version":"1.0","type":"link"}